raction of all UKIRT time over the next 5 years to undertake several public surveys using this new facility. These surveys are collectively known as the UKIRT Infrared Deep Sky Survey (UKIDSS). In this short paper I will describe the project and review the prospects for BD research using UKIDSS data, highlighting some of the major science goals related to BDs that we hope will be achieved.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1017\/s0074180900211182","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2016,7,20]],"date-time":"2016-07-20T08:37:05Z","timestamp":1469003825000},"page":"477-480","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":2,"title":["Brown Dwarfs in the UKIRT Infrared Deep Sky Survey (UKIDSS)"],"prefix":"10.1017","volume":"211","author":[{"given":"Nigel","family":"Hambly","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]}],"member":"56","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2016,5,26]]},"reference":[{"key":"S0074180900211182_ref4","first-page":"31","volume":"108","author":"Warren","year":"2002","journal-title":"ESO Messenger, No."},{"key":"S0074180900211182_ref3","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Lawrence A. , Hambly N. C. , Mann R. G. , Irwin M. J. , Lewis J. R. , McMahon R. G. , Adamson A. 2003, Proc. SPIE Vol. 4836, in press","DOI":"10.1117\/12.457008"},{"key":"S0074180900211182_ref2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1046\/j.1365-8711.1999.02283.x"},{"key":"S0074180900211182_ref5","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1086\/301513"},{"key":"S0074180900211182_ref1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1086\/324716"}],"container-title":["Symposium - International Astronomical Union"],"language":"en","link":[{"URL":"https:\/\/www.cambridge.org\/core\/services\/aop-cambridge-core\/content\/view\/S0074180900211182","content-type":"unspecified","content-version":"vor","intended-application":"similarity-checking"}],"deposited":{"date-parts":[[2025,6,4]],"date-time":"2025-06-04T02:55:17Z","timestamp":1749005717000},"sc